 HISTORY                                                          8249 1451
 -------                                                          8249 1451
 This library was produced by the Low Energy Interaction Physics  8249 1451
 (LEIP) group at NC State University, USA. The inelastic          8249 1451
 scattering thermal scattering law data for UO2 were developed    8249 1451
 using ab intio lattice dynamics methods [1,2]. The Full Law      8249 1451
 Analysis Scattering System Hub (FLASSH) code was used to produce 8249 1451
 File 7 MT=2 and 4 for U in UO2 and O in UO2 [3]. MAT=20 and      8249 1451
 ZA=120 were used for U in UO2 (HEU - 93% enrichment).            8249 1451
